+
+// Troops grow by (10 + troops^0.73 / 4) * (1 - troops / max), fastest at
+// 0.73 / 1.73 = 42% of max: pros keep their army near there and attack with the rest,
+// in boats of about 7% each instead of along the whole border (Bembe).
+const GROWTH_RATIO = 0.42;
+const PUNCH_RATIO = 0.07;
